# Olist raw data (~73MB, no file over 100MB -- geolocation/reviews/sellers
# CSVs dropped, unused by any script here) is committed directly, matching
# the convention already used for the same dataset in ecommerce-rto-risk-model
# -- clone and run with no Kaggle auth needed for that half of this project.
data/raw/olist/*.zip
data/raw/olist_marketing/*.zip

# Santander raw data is ~510MB across 35 parquet parts -- too large to commit
# to a portfolio git repo. Re-fetch with: python src/fetch_santander.py
# (requires a free Kaggle account + API token, see reports/03_SOURCE_REGISTER.md)
data/raw/santander/
